        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 55D2008, Modern Series Hand Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Hand Towel Holder is a stylish way to display your bathroom sink hand towels. It is easy to install and comes packaged with the necessary mounting hardware. The Modern Series Hand Towel Bar is made from solid brass and is available in your choice of  contemporary finish color. This Towel Ring is part of <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana 55D Modern Series\"><b>Deltana's Modern 55D Series</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-55D2008-specifications.gif?v=1704354531\" width=\"525\" height=\"245\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 55D2008 Towel Bar Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana 55D Modern Series\"><b>Deltana 55D Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Modern Bathroom Towel Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Bar Length: 8-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Drop Down Height: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance from Wall to the Bar: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Height: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-55D2008-specifications.pdf?v=1691095325\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 55D2008 Towel Bar Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 towel bar, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
